## 6. Advanced Write Options

### Schema Merge (Parquet / Delta)

```python
df.write \
    .option("mergeSchema", "true") \
    .mode("append") \
    .parquet("s3://bucket/output/")
# Adds new columns to existing schema instead of failing
```

### Write with Compression Codec

```python
# Compression options: snappy (fast), gzip (smaller), zstd (best ratio), none
df.write \
    .option("compression", "zstd") \
    .parquet("s3://bucket/output/")
```

### Max Records Per File

```python
df.write \
    .option("maxRecordsPerFile", 1_000_000) \
    .parquet("s3://bucket/output/")
# Prevents any single file from growing too large
```

