## 8. Format Decision Guide

```
Need fast analytics queries?              → Parquet (default)
Need ACID + upserts + time travel?        → Delta Lake
Writing to MySQL / Postgres / RDS?        → JDBC
Need human-readable output / debugging?  → JSON
Downstream system needs spreadsheet?     → CSV
Streaming output?                        → Delta / Kafka sink
```

---

## Common Mistakes Cheatsheet

| Mistake | Fix |
|---|---|
| `mode("overwrite")` wipes all partitions | Set `partitionOverwriteMode = dynamic` |
| Millions of tiny files | `coalesce()` or `maxRecordsPerFile` |
| Partitioning on high-cardinality column | Use low-cardinality cols only |
| `coalesce(1)` on huge DataFrame | Causes OOM — only for small data |
| JDBC write too slow | Increase `batchsize` + `numPartitions` |
| Schema mismatch on append | Use `mergeSchema = true` |